# Security pins for rhoai-3.5.4 CVE fixes (odh-autorag-rhel9):
# aiohttp 3.14.4 fixes CVE-2026-111064, CVE-2026-111066 (the previous 3.14.3 pin already covers CVE-2026-69243/-69244)
# urllib3 2.8.0 fixes CVE-2026-97687, CVE-2026-97689
# filelock 4.2.4 fixes CVE-2026-112940 (upstream fix is 4.2.1; 4.2.4 is the available index build)
# NOTE: pillow stays at 12.3.0 (CVE-2026-96640..-112897 unfixed here) because docling-slim 2.107.x
# caps pillow<13.0.0 and ai4rag 0.10.4 requires docling~=2.107.0. Bumping pillow needs a
# docling >= 2.132.0 index build (also the CVE-2026-105744 fix) plus an ai4rag rebuild.
aiohttp==3.14.4
urllib3==2.8.0
filelock==4.2.4
